        "answer": {
          "short": "$2<t<4$.",
          "worked": "Between $t=2$ and $t=4$, the graph rises and its positive gradient increases. Thus the price is increasing at an increasing rate for $2<t<4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
